{"3007650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rise of Realms", "steam_appid": 3007650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[20th April 2026] We have just opened a new playtest that includes many changes to the Battlefield, Buildings, Campaigns and quests, Characters, UI, Biomes and more.</strong><br>Hit the Wishlist button to keep up with our latest news and announcements and feel free to leave feedback and comments on our Discord server.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.poster.avif?t=1786647254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.webm?t=1786647254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for dominion over the lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based hex grid gameplay. Quick auto-chess battlefields for up to 7 armies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of several playable races and recruit powerful heroes to lead your armies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hero and unit rosters for each.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a rich 3D game world, where each faction spreads its unique biome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes custom made modular castles and an expansive list of faction-specific upgradeable buildings on the map.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect powerful items and cast spells with devastating effects to wipe out enemy armies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG progression systems allow specialization in a myriad of ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable hero has a unique combination of 3 different talent trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random map generation and quest systems ensure no two game sessions feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are randomly generated and populated with the required obstacles and objectives.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovingly hand-crafted by a small team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI generated models, textures, artwork, music or code.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[20th April 2026] We have just opened a new playtest that includes many changes to the Battlefield, Buildings, Campaigns and quests, Characters, UI, Biomes and more.</strong><br>Hit the Wishlist button to keep up with our latest news and announcements and feel free to leave feedback and comments on our Discord server.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.poster.avif?t=1786647254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/extras/0766f1f81a7de939e90b509def5ade1a.webm?t=1786647254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for dominion over the lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based hex grid gameplay. Quick auto-chess battlefields for up to 7 armies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of several playable races and recruit powerful heroes to lead your armies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hero and unit rosters for each.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a rich 3D game world, where each faction spreads its unique biome.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes custom made modular castles and an expansive list of faction-specific upgradeable buildings on the map.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect powerful items and cast spells with devastating effects to wipe out enemy armies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG progression systems allow specialization in a myriad of ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable hero has a unique combination of 3 different talent trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random map generation and quest systems ensure no two game sessions feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are randomly generated and populated with the required obstacles and objectives.<u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovingly hand-crafted by a small team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI generated models, textures, artwork, music or code.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Rise of Realms is a 4X RPG, for 1-6 players, in a medieval fantasy setting. Command an empire and recruit heroes to lead your armies. Use your tactical abilities to conquer the lands and reshape them in your image. Wishlist now.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/header.jpg?t=1786647254", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/0bca4b7c4aa8076a97598a457aae126fee60357b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786647254", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007650/0bca4b7c4aa8076a97598a457aae126fee60357b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786647254", "website": "https:/